** The [[Voidwaker]]'s special attack does not sever the lure due to being a Magic-based attack, but it still deals high damage. The Voidwaker can still sever the lure with its regular slash attack, saving an inventory slot by not requiring a second slash weapon.
* Some emergency [[food]] for dealing with [[elder aquanite]]s
* [[Rune pouch]] or [[divine rune pouch]] with [[runes]] to cast [[High Level Alchemy]] and [[Teleport to house]]
* [[Seed box]] for collecting the variety of seed drops (optional)
* [[Reagent pouch]] for collecting the common snape grass drops (optional)
** If you do not have the [[Reagent pouch]] you can instead bring [[Ranarr potion (unf)]] and combine them with any [[Snape grass]] drops you get.
* [[Bonecrusher]] (optional)

